Aiyagari1994.M10B1.zeroRate_cap_change_e:
Aiyagari1994.M10B1.zeroRate_cap_change_exact (m : Aiyagari1994.HouseholdPrimitives)
  (hsmooth : Aiyagari1994.UtilitySmooth m.utility) (hcurvature : Aiyagari1994.UtilityCurvature m.utility)
